ewyn</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name></person-group> <article-title>Memorandum to J Besques. Tobacco Institute. 24 Jan 1989.</article-title> <comment><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://legacy.library.ucsf.edu/tid/lxs52f00">http://legacy.library.ucsf.edu/tid/lxs52f00</ext-link></comment></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b34"><label>34</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><collab>National Cancer Institute</collab> <source>The role of the media in promoting and discouraging tobacco use. NCI Smoking and Tobacco Control Monograph</source>. <publisher-loc>Bethesda, MD</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>National Cancer Institute, National Institutes of Health (in press)</publisher-name></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b35"><label>35</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Saffer</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Chaloupka</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group> <article-title>The effect of tobacco advertising bans on tobacco consumption.</article-title> <source>J Health Econ</source> <year>2000</year>;<volume>19</volume>:<fpage>1117</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>37</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11186847</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>